flowchart LR
    App[Patient app] --> GW[API Gateway]
    GW --> SVC["Chat service<br/>(ECS Fargate, Python)"]
    SVC --> R{"Router<br/>rules, no AI"}
    R -->|escalate| ESC["SQS → care team inbox<br/>+ 911/988 message to patient now"]
    R -->|code| CODE[Order / appointment / billing APIs]
    R -->|faq| FAQ[Approved FAQ store]
    R -->|refuse| REF[Refusal template]
    R -->|answer| LLM["Bedrock: Sonnet 5.5<br/>approved sources in cached prompt"]
    LLM --> G{"Output guard<br/>checks the draft"}
    G -->|safe| OUT[Reply]
    G -->|HANDOFF / no source / dose instruction| ESC
    SVC -.-> LOG[("Audit log: route + reason<br/>KMS-encrypted, PII redacted")]
